  "bodyHash": "15318981625f632e",
  "content": "<p>Chewy Cheeses 让来自其他模组的奶酪使用 Brewin and Chewin 的发酵和陈化过程。</p>\n<p>每种奶酪都会拥有自己的奶酪轮、未成熟奶酪轮、杯垫模型以及奶酪流体，以实现完全整合。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/hbrQ6JvZYJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">DISCORD</a> 获取支持与更新</p>\n<h2>Rats mod</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_15107ebe-7720-47aa-ab9c-2ee967f8b818.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>添加了对奶酪、蓝纹奶酪和下界奶酪的支持</li>\n<li>为了避免混淆，“Cheese”已更名为“Rat Leicester Cheese”。（因为它类似于红莱斯特奶酪，但它是老鼠色的而不是红色的）</li>\n<li>添加了切割配方，将完整的奶酪块切成2个奶酪轮。</li>\n<li>添加了发酵配方，使用受污染的食物将其与 Rats 模组联系起来，以体现老鼠对这种风味的喜爱。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>注意：在 Rats 模组的配置文件中禁用奶酪发酵，即可禁用其模组的奶酪制作功能。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_a62b1625-c187-43e0-ae0c-901e607570fa.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Jaden's Nether Expansion</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_e16e6309-c985-41cd-b4c6-957a4a516dc5.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>添加了对发光奶酪的支持</li>\n<li>奶酪轮提供15级的光照等级</li>\n<li>未成熟的奶酪轮提供10级的光照等级</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"font-weight:400\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_ce4135cb-24ad-4b7e-81e9-e29ede8b4883.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>Dungeon's Delight</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_a8102c70-42be-408e-a1c8-ae3b9afe9f71.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>添加了对 Wardenzola 奶酪的支持</li>\n<li>将新奶酪块集成到地牢美味的标签和配方中</li>\n<li>在新物品中包含了怪物物品的稀有度信息&nbsp;</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_550d3a2f-02f4-41b0-b31d-c39b6a0dc9cb.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>Sniffer's Delicacies</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_c2b243ab-5732-4016-94af-1e418446f931.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>添加了对“Vieux Bulogne”奶酪的支持</li>\n<li>为嗅探兽奶创建了新的流体</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_a1704f97-ca18-4b26-840f-fd60dfbcadd4.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>Bonus Cheeses</h2>\n<p>该模组还添加了使用其他模组材料的新奶酪，以进一步扩展奶酪的整合范围。</p>\n<h2>Ender's Delight - Shulker Cheese</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_6a3a24a7-3800-4032-a91b-716ef9e3c4b6.png\"><img src=\"\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>使用来自末地的材料制成</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_ae2e3d43-df3c-45ed-b885-b5de32316724.png\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>Quark / Darker Depths - Glowshroom Cheese</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_0f3ca2db-a837-4989-9539-959858953fab.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>使用来自 Quark 或 Darker Depths 的发光蘑菇制成</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_0c3e0548-dbe0-4aa7-a5b9-70f111cd47fc.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>Environmental - Truffle Cheese</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_1bce0414-af24-4cc4-b3e7-a05f5e370d17.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>使用 Environmental 模组添加的松露制成</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_1a641b49-659f-451e-981d-120d3eb93022.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>Vanilla - Pitcher Cheese</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_c14131a7-8212-4c0a-b7eb-efc42059f8f5.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>使用从嗅探兽挖出的捕虫堇豆荚制成。虽然这不是模组兼容内容，但我们觉得嗅探兽需要更多的关爱和更广泛的整合。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_a19dcdd8-8587-4be2-b9b9-d01535fa3358.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>Other Supported Mods</h2>\n<p>一些模组不需要全新的奶酪轮即可获得支持。</p>\n<h2>Hearth and harvest</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li>为其奶酪的陈化过程添加了 JEI/EMI 支持</li>\n<li>为该模组添加的未成熟奶酪轮添加了发酵配方。这也涉及为山羊奶和熔化的奶酪创建新的流体</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_17d6fa61-958a-4efd-a195-59b7104c04a2.png\" alt=\"image\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_2fed6670-57dd-4c49-b09d-0757c7b740d8.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2>Farmer&rsquo;s Pizzeria</h2>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>为其奶酪的陈化过程添加了 JEI/EMI 支持</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1292685/description_2e9dc8ee-7522-4058-a5c0-3cf8d98a07f8.png\" alt=\"image\"></p>\n</div>",
